      <description>&lt;p&gt;We developed a novel machine learning pipeline leveraging electronic health records to identify early biomarkers of Alzheimer&amp;rsquo;s disease. Our approach integrates longitudinal patient data with ensemble methods, achieving state-of-the-art sensitivity in pre-symptomatic detection across a cohort of 15,000+ patients.&lt;/p&gt;
